Package: talib
Title: An Interface to 'TA-Lib' (Technical Analysis Library)
Version: 0.9-0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given   = "Serkan", 
      family  = "Korkmaz",
      email   = "serkor1@duck.com", 
      role    = c("cre", "aut", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5052-0982")
    )
  )
Description: An interface to the 'TA-Lib' technical analysis library. The package provides access to about 200 indicators (e.g., ADX, MACD, RSI, Stochastic, Bollinger Bands), candlestick pattern recognition and common rolling-window functions—implemented in 'C' for fast computations on open-high-low-close-volume (OHLC-V) time series for rule-based signal generation.
